        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: A Company of Swans, A Song for Summer, A Countess Below Stairs, The Reluctant Heiress, The Morning Gift\n- People: Patricia Veryan, Patricia Valeria Bannister\n- Topics: dedications, reissues, young adult market\n\nFacts:\n- Patricia Valeria Bannister was born on November 21, 1923, in London, England.\n- Patricia Veryan was the pen name of Patricia Valeria Bannister, a writer of historical romance fiction from 1978 until 2002.\n- Patricia Valeria Bannister died on November 18, 2009, in Bellevue, Washington, USA.\n- A Company of Swans is dedicated to Patricia Veryan.\n- A Song for Summer, A Countess Below Stairs, A Company of Swans, The Reluctant Heiress, and The Morning Gift were reissued between 2007 and 2009 for the young adult market.",
